      "text": "+-----------------------------------+\n  | UNTRUSTED LAYER (arbitrary code)  |\n  | - Tactics                         |\n  | - Search procedures               |\n  | - Decision procedures             |\n  | - Imported libraries              |\n  +-----------------------------------+\n              | produces\n              v\n  +-----------------------------------+\n  | TRUSTED KERNEL (abstract type)    |\n  | - Proof term: an abstract type    |\n  | - Only derivation rules can       |\n  |   construct values of type \"thm\"  |\n  | - Kernel validates EVERY step     |\n  | - Cannot forge a theorem          |\n  +-----------------------------------+"
